# Whitelist: Vivado/Vitis generate far more than is tracked here, so
# everything is ignored by default and only hand-edited files are re-included.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Vivado: build script, constraints file and xsa file
!hw/
!hw/*.tcl
!hw/constraints/
!hw/constraints/**
# Hardware hand-off to Vitis
!hw/sensorhub.xsa
# self written HDL & Testbenches
!hw/hdl/
!hw/hdl/**
!hw/tb/
!hw/tb/**

# Vitis: component settings and application sources
!sw/
!sw/sensorhub_platform/
!sw/sensorhub_platform/vitis-comp.json
!sw/httpd_webserver/
!sw/httpd_webserver/vitis-comp.json
!sw/httpd_webserver/src/
!sw/httpd_webserver/src/**
sw/httpd_webserver/src/compile_commands.json


